{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S05等较短屏幕中，未标注分时出现的感受词仍然偏密，容易让观众来不及逐条消化；这方面Y更清爽。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点关键词放大加亮，观众即使只扫一眼也比较容易抓住人物当下的心思；分时出现的感受词还能跟着音乐变化逐步补充信息。更重要的是，X保留了人物从害怕给对方负担、逐渐感到被接纳、开始期待相互依靠，到欢喜中越来越害怕失去，最后接受不确定性的完整心理变化。Y的叙述更顺口，部分段落也更清爽，但压缩掉了一些重要的心理层次和音乐细节，感受描写有时趋于概括。综合来看，X虽然局部拥挤，却更能让普通观众同时听见音乐的变化、看见人物的心思，并感受到两者之间的对应关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "814b908a-c0d2-44ad-86eb-c2a1999fb377", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T044930119559Z", "elapsed_seconds": 123.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:51:33.504698+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "dafa90234b826e6db54ec676c85a8cc58ebadb157b94f58bfa6078253865c108", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f9